%S A400566 1541054397764,3276465868701,750490721970850,791113521008620
%N A400566 Nonsquarefree numbers k such that sigma(k) = phi(k) + tau(k)^9.
%C A400566 All squarefree numbers k such that sigma(k) = phi(k) + tau(k)^9 are terms of the sequence A398806.
%H A400566 S. I. Dimitrov, <a href="https://github.com/Stoyan16/Non-squarefree-numbers-k-such-that-sigma-k-phi-k-tau-k-9/blob/main/A400566">Python program</a> (GitHub)
%e A400566 1541054397764 is a term since sigma(1541054397764) = 3263409313920 = 621601773696 + 24^9 = phi(1541054397764) + tau(1541054397764)^9.
%o A400566 (PARI) isok(k) = {my(f = factor(k)); !issquarefree(f) && sigma(f) - eulerphi(f) == numdiv(f)^9; } \\ _Amiram Eldar_, Sep 30 2026
%Y A400566 Cf. A000005, A000010, A000203, A013929, A398806, A399944, A399226, A400368, A400565.
%K A400566 nonn,hard,more,new
